<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00562">
	<title>Blind-Spot Collision-Avoidance Assist operation</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>blind-spot collision-avoidance assist (BCA) 
					<indexterm>operation</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>Blind-Spot Collision-Avoidance Assist will warn and control as following operation.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>Collision warning (while driving)</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Collision-avoidance assist (while departing)</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
</concept>